  "nodes": {
    "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks": {
      "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks",
      "type": "line",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l0",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "Two waters. The same table as before. You know the way.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:16"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l1",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "Just there, love. They can help themselves.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:17"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l2",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "Thank you, love. There is another barrel at the far end. Would you bring it over?",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:18"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l3",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "The one on the floor will do. I cannot reach the top ones either.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:21"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l4",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "Lovely. Thank you for making room. Bring it back to the bar when you have your breath, love.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:22"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l5",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "There we are. You have saved me a journey.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:23"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l6",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "Take these back while you are going that way.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:24"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l7",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "That is fine. Leave them on the dry part.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:25"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l8",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "You are very good. Nobody has ordered anything yet.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:26"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l9",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "No drinks for the other table. Take them while they are still cold.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:32"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l10",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "Oh, the floor has gone through again. There is another room underneath. Mind the tray.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:33"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l11",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "There is a dry place to land. I will keep your place at the bar.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:34"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l12",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "There it is. No harm done. You need not apologise to a tray.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:35"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l13",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "Thank you. I have put the empties downstairs. Could you fetch the next barrel?",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:36"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l14",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "One of the low ones, love. There is no ladder tall enough for those.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:42"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l15",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "Just by that gap. It used to be a wall.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:43"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l16",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "That is the cellar below the cellar. It will be all right down there.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:44"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l17",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "You go carefully. I have only just swept.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:45"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l18",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "There you are. I wondered where you had got to.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:46"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l19",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "Perfect. There is always somebody who comes back with it.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:47"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l20",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "Collect the drinks before they were poured. It saves washing up.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:48"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l21",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "That is their usual table. Just there.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:49"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l22",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "There. Everyone has what they did not ask for. Just one more little thing.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:50"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l23",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "There is one more at the back. Leave the rest. They can stay where they are.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:53"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l24",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "That will see us through. Come and take your hands off it.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:54"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l25",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "A clean glass for the table by the door. Nobody is waiting. I would like it to be ready.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:55"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l26",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "Thank you. It is nice to have a place ready.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:56"
        },
        {
          "id": "SOURCE_PUB.source-pub.rounds.tasks.l27",
          "who": "task",
          "text": "Thank you. That was kind of you. Your coat is dry now. The door is just where you left it.",
          "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:57"
        }
      ],
      "source": "src/data/source-pub.js:16"
    }
  }
}
